# Local-only Worker secrets and var overrides for `npm run dev` / `vite preview`.
# Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored) and fill in. Never commit real values.
# Deployed values are set with `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>` instead.
#
# Register, login, password change and account delete need all three.
# With Turnstile's dummy keys the widget and siteverify always pass (local
# dev still calls siteverify over the network). Tests never read this file.

# 32 random bytes: generate with `openssl rand -base64 32`
PASSWORD_PEPPER_V1=<generate: openssl rand -base64 32>

# Turnstile: use Cloudflare's dummy test keys for local development, listed at
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/troubleshooting/testing/
TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=<turnstile test site key from the page above>
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=<turnstile test secret key from the page above>
